00:12:36,200 --> 00:12:37,360
when you risk everything,

310
00:12:37,360 --> 00:12:38,280
the reward

311
00:12:39,480 --> 00:12:40,600
isn't always fair.

312
00:12:41,120 --> 00:12:42,200
Isn't that the thrill

313
00:12:42,200 --> 00:12:43,040
of being a pilot?

314
00:12:43,920 --> 00:12:44,840
Guess I'm still

315
00:12:44,840 --> 00:12:45,960
too green

316
00:12:46,320 --> 00:12:47,440
to fully appreciate it.

317
00:12:48,640 --> 00:12:49,720
I won't truly get it

318
00:12:49,720 --> 00:12:51,080
until I'm the captain

319
00:12:51,320 --> 00:12:52,320
flying our very own Z101!

320
00:13:02,480 --> 00:13:03,560
I've got a question

321
00:13:03,560 --> 00:13:04,240
for you.

322
00:13:04,880 --> 00:13:05,600
If I didn't double

323
00:13:05,600 --> 00:13:06,680
your signing bonus,

324
00:13:07,280 --> 00:13:07,800
would you

325
00:13:07,800 --> 00:13:09,120
still pick us?

326
00:13:09,520 --> 00:13:10,480
Just so you know,

327
00:13:11,480 --> 00:13:11,960
Yan An

328
00:13:12,040 --> 00:13:13,320
had a fat check

329
00:13:13,320 --> 00:13:14,160
ready for me too!

330
00:13:15,000 --> 00:13:15,960
Take it or leave it, mister.

331
00:13:16,760 --> 00:13:17,280
Yan An?

332
00:13:18,240 --> 00:13:19,240
Can he

333
00:13:19,240 --> 00:13:19,840
put you in

334
00:13:19,840 --> 00:13:21,080
a state-of-the-art Z101?

335
00:13:21,440 --> 00:13:21,760
Not right now,

336
00:13:22,520 --> 00:13:23,080
but give them

337
00:13:23,080 --> 00:13:23,960
a couple of years.

338
00:13:24,400 --> 00:13:25,520
And does he

339
00:13:25,520 --> 00:13:26,880
have an ace instructor

340
00:13:26,880 --> 00:13:27,840
like Captain Fan?

341
00:13:28,320 --> 00:13:28,760
OK, you got me there.

342
00:13:30,960 --> 00:13:31,720
Then shouldn't the lovely Ms. Ruan

343
00:13:33,560 --> 00:13:35,160
cut her boss

344
00:13:36,280 --> 00:13:37,200
a little more slack?

345
00:13:37,800 --> 00:13:38,440
Hey, I've been sweet alright?

346
00:13:43,400 --> 00:13:43,920
Though,

347
00:13:44,720 --> 00:13:45,360
props to Mr. Fu

348
00:13:45,360 --> 00:13:46,720
for the big check!

349
00:13:47,880 --> 00:13:48,600
Save

350
00:13:50,040 --> 00:13:51,400
a bit more,

351
00:13:52,240 --> 00:13:53,040
and I'll own my dream home.

352
00:14:00,360 --> 00:14:01,480
Captain Fan

353
00:14:02,600 --> 00:14:03,920
mentioned your situation.

354
00:14:05,280 --> 00:14:05,640
Relax,

355
00:14:06,200 --> 00:14:07,520
standard employee background check.

356
00:14:08,760 --> 00:14:09,080
I know

357
00:14:09,080 --> 00:14:10,160
you sold your house.

358
00:14:18,680 --> 00:14:20,000
[The paperwork is]

359
00:14:20,000 --> 00:14:21,040
[all wrapped up.]

360
00:14:21,160 --> 00:14:22,600
Next step is just finalizing the deed.

361
00:14:26,040 --> 00:14:26,800
Do you mind if I...

362
00:14:27,360 --> 00:14:28,400
stay a bit longer?

363
00:14:30,040 --> 00:14:30,280
Sure thing.

364
00:14:30,520 --> 00:14:30,880
Take your time.

365
00:14:31,040 --> 00:14:31,480
Thanks.

366
00:14:31,880 --> 00:14:32,560
I'll lock up

367
00:14:32,560 --> 00:14:33,560
on my way out.

368
00:14:34,120 --> 00:14:34,640
No problem.

369
00:14:34,640 --> 00:14:35,000
Thanks.

370
00:14:35,120 --> 00:14:36,280
See you, Ms. Ruan.

371
00:15:11,320 --> 00:15:12,160
[Look at you, missy!]

372
00:15:13,760 --> 00:15:14,520
[Hey, mister!]

373
00:15:14,640 --> 00:15:16,160
[Your wife's picking on me again!]

374
00:15:16,440 --> 00:15:17,240
[What's all this?]

375
00:15:19,120 --> 00:15:20,360
[Look at your messy little face!]

376
00:15:20,720 --> 00:15:21,600
[Don't bother your mom,]

377
00:15:22,240 --> 00:15:22,800
[go eat!]

378
00:15:23,280 --> 00:15:24,120
[Honey, breakfast is ready!]

379
00:15:24,760 --> 00:15:25,760
[Food time!]

380
00:15:26,160 --> 00:15:27,320
[I'll punish your mom later!]

381
00:15:28,160 --> 00:15:28,840
[Let's eat!]

382
00:15:30,440 --> 00:15:31,000
[Here, wipe those hands.]

383
00:15:31,240 --> 00:15:32,040
[Chop chop,]

384
00:15:32,040 --> 00:15:32,600
[you'll be late]

385
00:15:32,920 --> 00:15:33,840
[for class!]

386
00:15:35,040 --> 00:15:36,160
[Sweetheart, you need veggies.]

387
00:15:36,560 --> 00:15:38,040
[You can't just scarf down meat.]

388
00:15:38,720 --> 00:15:39,360
[Why not?]

389
00:15:39,600 --> 00:15:40,680
[No fiber means]

390
00:15:40,920 --> 00:15:41,680
[your plumbing gets plugged!]

391
00:15:42,360 --> 00:15:43,520
[My plumbing works perfectly, thanks!]

392
00:15:43,520 --> 00:15:44,000
[Nice try,]

393
00:15:44,000 --> 00:15:45,040
[you were stuck yesterday!]

394
00:15:46,240 --> 00:15:46,600
[Eat up.]

395
00:15:50,120 --> 00:15:50,440
[Uh oh...]

396
00:15:51,200 --> 00:15:52,240
[Plumbing's calling...]

397
00:15:53,320 --> 00:15:53,960
[Finish your plate,]

398
00:15:54,400 --> 00:15:55,160
[we gotta run!]

399
00:16:01,600 --> 00:16:03,000
[Dad, are you done in there?]

400
00:16:03,680 --> 00:16:04,200
[One sec!]

401
00:16:05,080 --> 00:16:06,800
[Hurry! The bell's gonna ring!]

402
00:16:06,920 --> 00:16:07,600
[Here I am!]

403
00:16:08,920 --> 00:16:10,360
[Preaching veggies]

404
00:16:10,360 --> 00:16:11,360
[when you're backed up!]

405
00:16:12,520 --> 00:16:12,920
[No sweat.]

406
00:16:13,200 --> 00:16:13,960
[If you're late,]

407
00:16:14,040 --> 00:16:15,080
[blame it on your lazy dad!]

408
00:16:15,600 --> 00:16:16,560
[You're teaching first period!]

409
00:16:18,080 --> 00:16:18,440
[Oops,]

410
00:16:19,080 --> 00:16:20,360
[my showcase lecture is today!]

411
00:16:20,360 --> 00:16:21,320
[Completely slipped my mind!]

412
00:16:21,800 --> 00:16:22,480
[Let's roll!]

413
00:16:24,480 --> 00:16:26,320
[Why is your face still painted?]

414
00:16:26,320 --> 00:16:27,560
[You can't walk on campus like that!]

415
00:16:29,720 --> 00:16:30,080
[Move, move!]

416
00:16:43,240 --> 00:16:43,800
[Did I pull too hard?]

417
00:16:44,040 --> 00:16:44,680
[Ow! It hurts!]

418
00:16:44,680 --> 00:16:45,720
[You ever used a comb before?!]

419
00:16:45,840 --> 00:16:46,680
[I practiced, I swear!]

420
00:16:47,040 --> 00:16:48,360
[Practiced on scalping?!]

421
00:16:48,640 --> 00:16:49,560
[Never mind,]

422
00:16:49,560 --> 00:16:50,280
[I'm out of here!]

423
00:18:13,000 --> 00:18:13,400
Mr. Fu,

424
00:18:15,880 --> 00:18:17,400
bad comfort feels worse than

425
00:18:18,720 --> 00:18:19,760
no comfort at all.

426
00:18:21,360 --> 00:18:21,720
Sorry.

427
00:18:27,720 --> 00:18:28,120
Not hungry?

428
00:18:29,840 --> 00:18:30,520
Guess it's mine then.

429
00:18:44,560 --> 00:18:45,080
Hey, lead!

430
00:18:45,240 --> 00:18:45,840
Evening, lead!

431
00:18:50,520 --> 00:18:52,360
[Sorry, the subscriber you dialed]

432
00:18:52,360 --> 00:18:53,480
[cannot be reached at the moment.]

433
00:18:53,840 --> 00:18:54,920
[Please dial later.]

434
00:19:19,080 --> 00:19:19,760
[I'm already back home.]

435
00:19:20,280 --> 00:19:21,000
[Must be a long day today.]

436
00:19:21,520 --> 00:19:22,560
[Turn in early.]

437
00:19:58,240 --> 00:19:58,520
Is this...

438
00:20:00,120 --> 00:20:01,120
Right through the gate.

439
00:20:04,200 --> 00:20:05,440
That's where you used to live?

440
00:20:08,160 --> 00:20:09,120
Where I used to live...

441
00:20:09,840 --> 00:20:10,480
and

442
00:20:11,360 --> 00:20:12,320
where I'm moving back very soon.

443
00:20:14,360 --> 00:20:14,920
Meaning?

444
00:20:16,360 --> 00:20:17,600
Thanks to the boss'

445
00:20:18,240 --> 00:20:19,840
fat signing bonus!

446
00:20:21,160 --> 00:20:22,080
Though prices jumped

447
00:20:22,400 --> 00:20:23,600
since it's school-zoned,

448
00:20:24,000 --> 00:20:25,640
so I'm still a little short.

449
00:20:26,600 --> 00:20:27,400
Give me some time,

450
00:20:27,880 --> 00:20:29,680
and I'll reclaim it.

451
00:20:30,640 --> 00:20:30,920
C'mon,

452
00:20:31,360 --> 00:20:32,000
I'll show you around.

453
00:20:45,920 --> 00:20:47,080
You see that window?

454
00:20:47,480 --> 00:20:48,360
That was my whole life

455
00:20:49,040 --> 00:20:50,080
for twenty years.

456
00:20:51,040 --> 00:20:52,240
We had our

457
00:20:52,600 --> 00:20:53,880
kitchen table right there.

458
00:20:54,760 --> 00:20:55,480
Dad and I

459
00:20:55,960 --> 00:20:56,880
would have breakfast together

460
00:20:57,280 --> 00:20:58,360
every single day.

461
00:21:07,840 --> 00:21:08,200
What's with the stares?

462
00:21:11,120 --> 00:21:11,560
No reason.

463
00:21:18,520 --> 00:21:19,360
Mark my words,

464
00:21:21,000 --> 00:21:21,640
I'm moving back in.

465
00:21:28,400 --> 00:21:29,760
Guess I overshared tonight.

466
00:21:30,560 --> 00:21:30,880
C'mon.

467
00:21:57,040 --> 00:21:58,240
Thanks for walking me back.

468
00:22:00,440 --> 00:22:01,000
Sixian.

469
00:22:03,920 --> 00:22:04,360
Yeah?

470
00:22:07,560 --> 00:22:07,960
Never mind.

471
00:22:09,320 --> 00:22:09,640
Get some rest.

472
00:22:11,920 --> 00:22:12,280
Uh... you too.

473
00:23:07,880 --> 00:23:09,400
[She is amazing.]

474
00:23:10,160 --> 00:23:11,360
[And do you remember]

475
00:23:12,320 --> 00:23:13,040
[the aftermath?]

476
00:23:13,520 --> 00:23:15,120
[She became a celebrity pilot,]

477
00:23:15,360 --> 00:23:16,200
[a trainer,]

478
00:23:16,600 --> 00:23:17,520
[and now my mentor.]

479
00:23:17,880 --> 00:23:18,280
[What you getting at?]

480
00:23:20,560 --> 00:23:20,920
[Just saying...]

481
00:23:21,480 --> 00:23:22,120
[Sixian.]

482
00:23:23,440 --> 00:23:23,880
[Yeah?]

483
00:23:26,400 --> 00:23:26,880
[Never mind.]

484
00:23:40,280 --> 00:23:40,560
Uh...

485
00:23:40,800 --> 00:23:42,040
Mr. Wang...

486
00:23:42,800 --> 00:23:43,200
My bad...

487
00:23:43,200 --> 00:23:44,200
Got an emergency!

488
00:23:45,600 --> 00:23:46,160
Of course it's you,

489
00:23:46,440 --> 00:23:47,280
always a whirlwind!

490
00:23:47,760 --> 00:23:48,200
What now?

491
00:23:48,560 --> 00:23:48,880
Mr. Wang,

492
00:23:49,440 --> 00:23:50,200
have you heard?

493
00:23:50,200 --> 00:23:51,200
Captain Fan got suspended!

494
00:23:51,360 --> 00:23:52,440
There's no way this is fair!

495
00:23:52,880 --> 00:23:53,920
And what exactly is your plan?

496
00:23:54,280 --> 00:23:55,760
I'm demanding answers from the higher-ups!

497
00:23:56,280 --> 00:23:56,960
Hold your horses!

498
00:23:59,600 --> 00:24:00,200
Come to my office.

499
00:24:00,960 --> 00:24:01,200
Right now.

500
00:24:01,840 --> 00:24:02,280
Take a seat.

501
00:24:02,680 --> 00:24:03,200
I'll get you some water.

502
00:24:04,920 --> 00:24:05,560
Sit.

503
00:24:05,840 --> 00:24:06,840
I can't just sit here!

504
00:24:06,840 --> 00:24:07,560
I need to fix this!

505
00:24:08,600 --> 00:24:09,560
Will you stop panicking?

506
00:24:09,760 --> 00:24:11,560
I know you're upset,

507
00:24:11,640 --> 00:24:13,520
and I know what you're gonna say!

508
00:24:13,760 --> 00:24:14,560
That's why

509
00:24:14,560 --> 00:24:15,680
I brought you here,

510
00:24:15,880 --> 00:24:17,920
to stop you from doing something reckless!

511
00:24:19,400 --> 00:24:20,240
Stay in this chair.

512
00:24:22,440 --> 00:24:24,640
Upper management has their protocols.

513
00:24:25,520 --> 00:24:27,280
It's just temporary,

514
00:24:27,880 --> 00:24:28,560
don't blow a gasket!

515
00:24:29,480 --> 00:24:30,960
A suspension ruins careers!

516
00:24:31,760 --> 00:24:33,640
Captain Fan did the right thing!

517
00:24:34,280 --> 00:24:35,560
Touchdown was flawless,

518
00:24:35,800 --> 00:24:36,920
the passenger got emergency care,

519
00:24:37,320 --> 00:24:37,800
and Mr. Fu

520
00:24:37,800 --> 00:24:39,080
literally treated us to lunch!

521
00:24:39,240 --> 00:24:41,240
You think I don't know that?

522
00:24:41,520 --> 00:24:42,760
Going to the department head is pointless.

523
00:24:43,280 --> 00:24:44,400
He has zero say in this!

524
00:24:44,440 --> 00:24:44,760
Fine.

525
00:24:45,560 --> 00:24:46,160
I'll bypass him.

526
00:24:47,080 --> 00:24:48,000
I'm asking Mr. Fu directly!

527
00:24:48,640 --> 00:24:49,720
I wanna know which one was genuine,

528
00:24:49,720 --> 00:24:50,560
yesterday's feast,

529
00:24:50,560 --> 00:24:51,520
or today's punishment!

530
00:24:52,440 --> 00:24:53,880
Barging into his office won't help!

531
00:24:53,880 --> 00:24:55,160
This came from the top!

532
00:24:55,480 --> 00:24:56,360
Heart-to-heart,

533
00:24:56,760 --> 00:24:59,280
we're all rooting for cap.

534
00:24:59,520 --> 00:25:00,400
But our

535
00:25:00,400 --> 00:25:02,080
safety assessment system tripped.

536
00:25:02,920 --> 00:25:04,160
Whenever an incident

537
00:25:04,400 --> 00:25:04,920
gets logged,

538
00:25:04,920 --> 00:25:06,400
you get grounded pending review.

539
00:25:06,440 --> 00:25:07,840
Protocols are

540
00:25:08,120 --> 00:25:09,160
written by people!

541
00:25:09,560 --> 00:25:10,920
They aren't set in stone.

542
00:25:11,320 --> 00:25:12,880
She literally saved a passenger!

543
00:25:12,880 --> 00:25:13,960
She deserves commendation.

544
00:25:14,240 --> 00:25:15,720
Can't Fu Mingyu see that?

545
00:25:15,720 --> 00:25:16,280
Sixian,

546
00:25:16,960 --> 00:25:17,880
wake up!

547
00:25:18,280 --> 00:25:19,080
Captain Fan already

548
00:25:19,560 --> 00:25:20,440
accepted the penalty

549
00:25:20,440 --> 00:25:21,680
first thing this morning!

550
00:25:22,800 --> 00:25:23,640
Going on a crusade now

551
00:25:23,800 --> 00:25:24,840
isn't defending her;

552
00:25:24,840 --> 00:25:25,880
it's making things worse!

553
00:25:31,120 --> 00:25:31,800
Plant yourself right here

554
00:25:32,200 --> 00:25:33,400
and finish the glass.

555
00:25:33,920 --> 00:25:34,760
Get your head straight.

556
00:25:36,480 --> 00:25:37,360
Not a step till you finish every drop!

557
00:26:02,520 --> 00:26:03,080
This hits

558
00:26:03,480 --> 00:26:04,640
way too close to home!

559
00:26:05,320 --> 00:26:06,160
You bleed

560
00:26:06,160 --> 00:26:07,080
for this job all shift,

561
00:26:07,080 --> 00:26:08,160
and instead of a "thank you,"

562
00:26:09,400 --> 00:26:10,840
they basically hand you a pink slip!

563
00:26:11,440 --> 00:26:12,200
That's totally unfair!

564
00:26:12,360 --> 00:26:12,760
Exactly!

565
00:26:14,240 --> 00:26:14,880
It feels like

566
00:26:14,880 --> 00:26:16,080
a complete betrayal!

567
00:26:16,640 --> 00:26:18,400
And I was strolling down the street

568
00:26:18,400 --> 00:26:19,360
with him like a naive school girl,

569
00:26:20,080 --> 00:26:20,680
opening up

570
00:26:20,680 --> 00:26:21,880
about my childhood home!

571
00:26:22,440 --> 00:26:23,680
I thought we were connecting,

572
00:26:23,920 --> 00:26:24,600
meanwhile he was

573
00:26:24,600 --> 00:26:25,120
sharpening his axe

574
00:26:25,120 --> 00:26:26,040
for his own frontline staff!

575
00:26:26,320 --> 00:26:26,920
Pause,

576
00:26:27,280 --> 00:26:28,000
back up a second.

577
00:26:28,920 --> 00:26:30,440
When did you two

578
00:26:31,520 --> 00:26:32,120
become besties?

579
00:26:32,600 --> 00:26:33,760
Stay on subject, MISSY!

580
00:26:36,280 --> 00:26:37,320
You seriously defending

581
00:26:37,400 --> 00:26:39,200
Mr. Corporate Coldheart again?

582
00:26:39,600 --> 00:26:40,560
I never defend him,

583
00:26:40,560 --> 00:26:42,200
alright?

584
00:26:42,720 --> 00:26:44,200
I'm just

585
00:26:44,200 --> 00:26:45,400
analyzing the facts.

586
00:26:45,840 --> 00:26:47,600
He is the VP.

587
00:26:47,880 --> 00:26:49,320
He's forced to sign off

588
00:26:49,320 --> 00:26:50,320
on corporate policies,

589
00:26:50,600 --> 00:26:51,880
even if he secretly

590
00:26:52,200 --> 00:26:53,840
hates them.

591
00:26:54,400 --> 00:26:55,120
Otherwise,

592
00:26:55,400 --> 00:26:56,160
why was he

593
00:26:56,160 --> 00:26:57,560
so painfully tongue-tied

594
00:26:57,960 --> 00:26:58,640
when he

595
00:26:58,640 --> 00:26:59,600
walked you back?

596
00:27:00,000 --> 00:27:01,400
He benched my idol,

597
00:27:02,160 --> 00:27:03,400
and I'm supposed to sympathize with his pain?!

598
00:27:03,720 --> 00:27:04,120
OK, truce!

599
00:27:04,400 --> 00:27:05,480
I'm on your side!

600
00:27:06,080 --> 00:27:07,720
Don't aim your anger at me!

601
00:27:07,960 --> 00:27:09,720
Cap got

602
00:27:10,000 --> 00:27:11,360
completely

603
00:27:11,360 --> 00:27:12,120
screwed!

604
00:27:12,400 --> 00:27:13,880
She did the right thing

605
00:27:14,160 --> 00:27:14,840
and got suspended for it!

606
00:27:18,720 --> 00:27:19,080
