00:39:19,320 --> 00:39:19,640
What?

914
00:39:20,640 --> 00:39:22,160
Since when do I need Mr. Fu's clearance?

915
00:39:24,480 --> 00:39:24,840
Why him?

916
00:39:26,440 --> 00:39:28,440
I said, he was offering me a ride.

917
00:39:28,920 --> 00:39:30,480
If you're tipsy, go sleep it off!

918
00:39:42,920 --> 00:39:43,600
Hands off!

919
00:39:44,200 --> 00:39:45,680
You policing my social life now?!

920
00:39:46,080 --> 00:39:47,440
Major boundary violation, boss.

921
00:39:47,560 --> 00:39:48,640
You sign my paychecks,

922
00:39:49,600 --> 00:39:50,560
you don't own

923
