924
00:39:53,920 --> 00:39:54,480
Don't tell me...

925
00:39:55,080 --> 00:39:56,320
Tired of being my boss?

926
00:39:57,520 --> 00:39:58,640
Wanna be my boyfriend instead?

927
00:40:01,680 --> 00:40:02,440
In your wildest dreams!

928
00:40:31,680 --> 00:40:32,080
Hi there!

929
00:40:32,640 --> 00:40:32,960
Hello!

930
00:40:33,240 --> 00:40:34,120
I'm scheduled to see Mr. Fu.

931
00:40:34,840 --> 00:40:36,000
He's in a briefing.

932
00:40:36,160 --> 00:40:38,080
Why don't you wait inside his office?

933
00:40:45,120 --> 00:40:45,560
Make yourself comfortable.

934
00:40:48,440 --> 00:40:49,760
Water for you.

935
00:41:03,960 --> 00:41:05,200
