936
00:41:05,360 --> 00:41:06,440
Everything's booked?

937
00:41:06,600 --> 00:41:07,040
Yes,

938
00:41:07,120 --> 00:41:07,760
sir.

939
00:41:07,880 --> 00:41:08,640
All squared away.

940
00:41:11,200 --> 00:41:11,800
Hey, Mingyu...

941
00:41:12,400 --> 00:41:13,120
