943
00:41:14,160 --> 00:41:15,080
Ta-da! The new proposal!

944
00:41:15,280 --> 00:41:16,400
Pulled all-nighters for it!

945
00:41:17,440 --> 00:41:17,960
Guaranteed to blow your mind!

946
00:41:18,920 --> 00:41:19,200
Sir,

947
00:41:19,760 --> 00:41:20,960
the instructor is ready

948
00:41:21,160 --> 00:41:21,880
