949
00:41:22,520 --> 00:41:23,360
My schedule is packed.

950
00:41:23,720 --> 00:41:24,560
You'll have to wait.

951
00:41:25,120 --> 00:41:25,400
Let's move.

952
00:41:25,800 --> 00:41:26,520
Right, business first...

953
00:41:28,560 --> 00:41:30,080
Wait, by "wait"...

954
00:41:31,280 --> 00:41:32,120
how many hours are we talking...

955
00:41:36,800 --> 00:41:37,920
[JUST A DESPERATE VENDOR!]

956
00:41:39,920 --> 00:41:40,640
So

957
00:41:40,920 --> 00:41:42,560
that's the story of

958
00:41:42,560 --> 00:41:43,920
how I earned

959
00:41:43,920 --> 00:41:45,400
my wings at

960
00:41:46,000 --> 00:41:46,720
Hengshi Airlines.

961
00:41:47,280 --> 00:41:48,040
Hope it gives you all

962
00:41:48,040 --> 00:41:49,000
some inspiration.

963
00:41:50,280 --> 00:41:50,920
Thank you!

964
00:41:57,640 --> 00:41:58,320
Honestly,

965
00:41:58,680 --> 00:41:59,480
I'd love to

966
00:41:59,480 --> 00:42:00,840
visit again

967
00:42:00,840 --> 00:42:01,720
to geek out

968
00:42:02,440 --> 00:42:04,040
over

969
00:42:04,360 --> 00:42:05,080
single-pilot cockpits

970
00:42:05,160 --> 00:42:06,560
