971
00:42:06,920 --> 00:42:07,400
Next time,

972
00:42:07,400 --> 00:42:09,160
I'll bring my colleague,

973
00:42:09,280 --> 00:42:10,680
Ruan Sixian.

974
00:42:11,240 --> 00:42:12,840
She's actually an alum

975
00:42:12,840 --> 00:42:13,680
