976
00:42:14,400 --> 00:42:15,800
When we first flew together,

977
00:42:15,800 --> 00:42:16,920
I wondered

978
00:42:16,920 --> 00:42:18,200
what school

979
00:42:18,520 --> 00:42:18,880
produces

980
00:42:18,880 --> 00:42:20,160
