981
00:42:20,520 --> 00:42:21,960
Standing here today,

982
00:42:22,720 --> 00:42:23,400
it all makes sense.

983
00:42:23,800 --> 00:42:24,880
You guys are incredible.

984
00:42:25,560 --> 00:42:26,520
I wish I could

985
00:42:26,520 --> 00:42:27,600
relive my college days

986
00:42:28,120 --> 00:42:29,280
at a campus as great as this.

987
00:42:30,440 --> 00:42:31,600
We still got time.

988
00:42:32,560 --> 00:42:34,120
Hit me with

989
00:42:34,120 --> 00:42:35,600
whatever questions

990
00:42:36,160 --> 00:42:37,840
