991
00:42:38,640 --> 00:42:39,400
Don't hold back!

992
00:42:43,160 --> 00:42:43,800
Yes.

993
00:42:44,720 --> 00:42:45,720
Captain Yue,

994
00:42:46,160 --> 00:42:47,120
