1013
00:43:12,360 --> 00:43:13,280
[Are you on the market?]

1014
00:43:18,560 --> 00:43:19,880
[Guilty as charged.]

1015
00:43:20,480 --> 00:43:21,680
[Still very single]

1016
00:43:22,000 --> 00:43:22,720
[and flying solo.]

1017
00:43:23,360 --> 00:43:24,080
[Yes!]

1018
00:43:24,920 --> 00:43:25,440
[Haha, appreciate the love!]
